    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPROVINCIAL COUNCILS (AMENDMENT)ACT, No. 13 OF 2010\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 30th October, 2010]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 10.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of November 04, 2010\n\n1Provincial Councils (Amendment)Act, No. 13 of 2010\n\nShort title.\n\n[Certified on 30th October, 2010]\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 35/2008\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE PROVINCIAL COUNCILS ACT, NO. 42 OF 1987\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Provincial Councils(Amendment) Act, No. 13 of 2010.\n\n2.Section 25 of the Provincial Councils Act, No. 42 of1987 is hereby amended in subsection (1) of that section bythe substitution for the words \u201cthree months before thecommencement of such financial year\u201d, of the words \u201conemonth before the commencement of such financial year\u201d.\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nAmendment ofsection 25 ofAct, No. 42 of1987.\n\nSinhala text toprevail in caseof inconsistency.\n\n2Provincial Councils (Amendment)Act, No. 13 of 2010\n\nAnnual subscription of English Bills and Acts of the Parliament Rs. 885 (Local), Rs. 1,180(Foreign), Payable to the SUPERINTENDENT, GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, DEPARTMENT OFGOVERNMENT INFORMATION, NO. 163, KIRULAPONA MAWATHA, POLHENGODA, COLOMBO 05 before 15thDecember each year in respect of the year following."
