ch societyor institution\u201d.\n\nAmendment ofSection 5 of theprincipalenactment.\n\nAmendment ofsection 6 of theprincipalenactment.\n\n3Gramodaya Mandala Fund (Amendment)\n\nAct, No. 68 of 2009"
