    "chunk_text": "PRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00 Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\nPARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of September 28, 2007\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Certified on 24th September, 2007]\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nFINANCE (AMENDMENT)ACT, No. 37 OF 2007\n\nFinance (Amendment) Act, No. 37 of 20071\n\nShort title.\n\n[Certified on 24th September, 2007]\n\nL. D. \u2014 O. 38/2007.\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE FINANCE ACT, NO. 11 OF 2004\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Finance (Amendment)Act, No. 37 of 2007.\n\n2.Part II (Cellular Mobile Telephone Subscribers\u2019 Levy)of the Finance Act, No. 11 of 2004 is hereby amended insection 14 thereof by the substitution for the words \u201cat therate of two and half per centum\u201d of the words \u201cat the rate often per centum\u201d.\n\n3.In the event of an inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nAmendment ofsection 14 ofAct, No. 11 of2004.\n\nSinhala text toprevail in case ofinconsistency.\n\n2Finance (Amendment) Act, No. 37 of 2007\n\nAnnual subscription of English Bills and Acts of the Parliament Rs. 885 (Local), Rs. 1,180(Foreign), Payable to the SUPERINTENDENT, GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, DEPARTMENT OFGOVERNMENT INFORMATION, NO. 163, KIRULAPONA MAWATHA, POLHENGODA, COLOMBO 05 before 15thDecember each year in respect of the year following."
