    "chunk_text": "(e) open and close current, savings and deposit accountsin any bank or banks and borrow or raise money withor without security ;\n\nGeneral powersof theCorporation.\n\n3Shantha Children's Education Services Foundation(Incorporation) Act, No. 19 of 2007\n\n(g) to do all such other acts and things as are incidentalor conducive to the carrying out of the objects of theCorporation.\n\n5.(1) The Corporation shall cause proper accounts tobe kept of its income and expenditure assets and liabilitiesand all other transactions of the Corporation.\n\n(2) The accounts of the Corporation shall be audited by aqualified auditor appionted by the Committee ofManagement.\n\n6.(1) The affairs of the Corporation shall, subject tothe provisions of this Act and the rules in force for the timebeing be administered by a Committee of Managementconsisting of eleven following members :\u2014\n\n(a) Hon. President, Hon. Vice President, General Secretary,Assistant Secretary, Treasurer; and\n\n(b) six other members elected in accordance with the rulesin force for the time being of the Corporation.\n\n(2) The first Committee of Management of theCorporation shall consist of the members of the Committeeof Management of the Foundation holding office on the dayimmediately preceding the date of commencement of thisAct.\n\n7.(1) It shall be lawful for the Corporation from time totime at any General Meeting and by a majority of not lessthan two-thirds of the members present and voting to makerules, not inconsistent with the provisions of this Act or anyother written law for the following matters :\u2014\n\n(a) the admission to and withdrawal or expulsion ofmembership and the membership fees payable ;\n\nAudit andAccounts.\n\nManagement ofthe Corporation.\n\nRules of theCorporation.\n\n4Shantha Children's Education Services Foundation(Incorporation) Act, No. 19 of 2007\n\n(b) the election of members of the Committee ofManagement and their powers and duties ;\n\n(c) the duties and functions of the officers and servantsof the Corporation ;"
